 ight delicious beers.</p><p>Since launching in 1998\, the Rocky Mountain W
 ine &amp\; Food Festival\, presented by Sobeys Liquor &amp\; Safeway Liquo
 r\, has been Alberta’s largest and most beloved food &amp\; adult bevera
 ge event\, welcoming hundreds of exhibitors and thousands of guests travel
 ling from across Western Canada each year!</p><p>The Rocky Mountain Wine &
 amp\; Food Festival is an opportunity to taste and try a selection of adul
 t beverages and local cuisine\, while learning about the processes and peo
 ple behind your favourite sips and bites! Discover and explore a variety o
 f fine wines\, premium spirits\, and craft beers\, and meet chefs from loc
 al restaurants who will be serving up delicious fare to pair with the wond
 erful assortment of drinks!</p><p>Friday\, Nov. 6 Evening Session: 5:30p.m
 .-10:000p.m.</p><p>Saturday\, Nov. 7 Afternoon Session: 12:00p.m.-4:00p.m.
